post-it: Computer's colours have changed
cause: Wrong colour scheme
symptoms:
	Colours look wrong
checks:
	yes: High contrast colour scheme
		shows: Display Properties, Appearance: High Contrast Black
	no: Wallpaper is a picture of the desktop
	yes: Picture is clean
	no: Coloured blocks and torn lines on screen
	no: Sound is muted
	no: No screensaver set
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: Windows takes long to start
software steps:
	Display Properties, Appearance
	Pick Windows Standard
	Apply
